{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>Observed</b> — twice in the Masorah: ליל שמורים, שמורים לכל בני ישראל — the portion the Holy One, blessed be He, allotted. A night of 15 for the years: half for the Exodus from Egypt, and the other half for the future redemption, to come."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:40.105621707Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}